<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Path Traversal">
  <data key="d0">Path Traversal</data>
  <data key="d1">attacktechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Path Traversal is a security vulnerability and weakness class in software systems where an attacker manipulates file path input to access files or directories outside the intended scope of the application. This occurs when server-side logic processes user-controlled input as a file path without proper validation, allowing the attacker to traverse the file system using sequences such as "../" to reach unauthorized files. The vulnerability arises from inadequate input validation, enabling unauthorized access to restricted files, system directories, or sensitive data. Attackers exploit this weakness by submitting crafted path inputs that bypass access controls, leading to potential data breaches, system compromise, or privilege escalation. Path Traversal is commonly found in web applications that handle file operations based on user input, such as file download or image display features. It is a critical issue in secure software development, as it undermines the principle of least privilege and can result in significant security risks. The vulnerability is also known as directory traversal, and it highlights the importance of robust input sanitization and secure file access mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-294b9877be94f50d0e74d0aa6ca0627b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e8b98451fa828a77a410acce1592cf2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-00