  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">An attack methodology where an attacker crafts paths to access files or resources outside the webroot or beyond extracted and included file locations.&lt;SEP&gt;A testing action that exploits input validation failures by injecting path traversal sequences (e.g., `../`) to access restricted files or directories.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-004</data>
