</node>
<node id="ActionScript">
  <data key="d0">ActionScript</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A scripting language mentioned as an alternative to JavaScript for XSS payload exploitation.&lt;SEP&gt;ECMAScript-based language used by Flash applications for interactivity and scripting, including versions 1.0, 2.0, and 3.0.&lt;SEP&gt;Programming language used within Flash content to control behavior, making it prone to injection and execution attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The scripting language used by Adobe Flash applications to implement interactive functionality and logic.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-003</data>
