<node id="PHP">
  <data key="d0">PHP</data>
  <data key="d1">technologystack</data>
  <data key="d2">PHP is a server-side scripting language commonly used in web applications and web development. It functions as a runtime environment often found on web servers and is embedded in web content to generate dynamic web pages. PHP is frequently employed in web application frameworks and is a core component of many web application technology stacks. Its code processing behavior is influenced by file inclusion functions, which can impact execution and security. PHP scripts are executed within the target application environment, making it a key technology in the application stack. When used in conjunction with databases like MongoDB, improper implementation—such as through injection vulnerabilities—can allow manipulation via valid variable names like `$where`. As a server-side scripting language, PHP plays a significant role in shaping attack methodologies due to its widespread use in target environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4bbd60ae8a8276a511522c70e38b3d51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1fdc50b475aa40c6258b79abf9a867a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3145270b6ffe0fd7611c4610be0770a9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-01-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-05-6-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-info-08-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-11-1-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ea557e757697285d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
