  <data key="d0">Double Quotes</data>
  <data key="d1">PayloadPattern</data>
  <data key="d2">A single quote or double quote character used to break out of single-quoted attribute values in injection attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-01-methodology.md</data>
