  <data key="d0">Stored Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Database stored operations within the application logic that may contain unsanitized user inputs susceptible to injection.&lt;SEP&gt;A stored block of code in the Oracle database that defines implementation logic for specific operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Feature introduced in MySQL 5.0.x allowing SQL code execution within the database.&lt;SEP&gt;A compiled database routine stored and available for execution on the server, subject to privilege checks.</data>
