<node id="Time Delay">
  <data key="d0">Time Delay</data>
  <data key="d1">attacktechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Time Delay refers to a measurable delay in response time that serves as an observable signal in the context of time-based inference techniques, particularly within security testing and exploitation scenarios. This delay occurs when a system or process experiences a pause in its response due to the execution of specific operations, such as database commands involving delay functions. These delays are intentionally induced to infer information about a system's internal state or structure, often in the context of time-based injection attacks. The presence of a Time Delay indicates that a time-based technique has been executed, and it can confirm the success of inference-based attacks by revealing whether a particular condition or query has been evaluated. Such delays are used to extract data indirectly by observing the timing of responses, as a longer response time suggests that a specific operation—such as a conditional query—has been processed. The signal of a Time Delay is often interpreted as evidence that a time-based inference mechanism is active, and it can be leveraged to deduce information about the underlying system, including the presence of vulnerabilities. This technique is commonly applied in penetration testing and web application security assessments to exploit time-based blind SQL injection or similar scenarios where direct data retrieval is not possible. The delay serves as a covert channel, allowing attackers to infer data through response timing rather than direct output. In all cases, the detection of a Time Delay is a critical indicator of time-based behavior and is used to validate the execution of inference-based methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
