<node id="MySQL">
  <data key="d0">MySQL</data>
  <data key="d1">technologystack</data>
  <data key="d2">MySQL is a relational database management system used in the target environment. It serves as a key component of the database technology stack relevant to the target system and application. As a relational database management system, MySQL is specifically targeted for testing input validation and query injection methods, particularly in the context of SQL injection tests. The behavior and capabilities of MySQL vary across different version numbers, which influences the outcomes and approaches of SQL injection testing. It is a widely used database technology in the target environment and plays a central role in the database infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-df80c9fe91c3765dc83d86ba6565a823-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-df80c9fe91c3765dc83d86ba6565a823-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-df80c9fe91c3765dc83d86ba6565a823-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001</data>
