  <data key="d2">A specific implementation of the SQL Database technology stack commonly used as a target.&lt;SEP&gt;A backend relational database management system relevant to SQL injection testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A relational database management system used as the target platform for testing inputs and SQL execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A relational database management system commonly attacked via input validation vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A relational database management system used in the target environment.&lt;SEP&gt;An open-source relational database system.&lt;SEP&gt;A database management system used in the target environment.</data>
