<node id="UNION SELECT Payload">
  <data key="d0">UNION SELECT Payload</data>
  <data key="d1">payloadpattern</data>
  <data key="d2">Malicious input containing UNION SELECT syntax used to retrieve additional data columns beyond the expected result set.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable malicious input pattern using the UNION operator to merge authenticated rows with arbitrary data.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable payload pattern that uses UNION SELECT to extract data.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable payload structure using UNION SELECT to extract data from SQL queries.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000</data>
