</node>
<node id="Time-Based SQL Payload">
  <data key="d0">Time-Based SQL Payload</data>
  <data key="d1">payloadpattern</data>
  <data key="d2">Malicious input using time delays (e.g., BENCHMARK or sleep functions) injected into SQL to determine blind injection vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A recon technique using deliberate delays such as `WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:5'` to infer query execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable payload pattern that uses time delays to infer SQL injection.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable payload structure using time delays to infer SQL injection success.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000</data>
