<node id="Server-Side Request Forgery">
  <data key="d0">Server-Side Request Forgery</data>
  <data key="d1">vulnerabilityclass</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness class where improperly validated input leads to the server making outbound requests to unintended origins.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class targeted by WSTG-INPV-19 that allows attackers to craft requests routing to unintended internal/external resources&lt;SEP&gt;A vulnerability class where the server is tricked into making requests to internal resources.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical weakness allowing an attacker to make the server request arbitrary URLs.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where the server is tricked into making requests to internal resources.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where the server can be made to make requests to internal or external resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1724f5a35cf4fa9478c28ef76ea64632-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1724f5a35cf4fa9478c28ef76ea64632-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000</data>
