<node id="Bash Brace Expansion">
  <data key="d0">Bash Brace Expansion</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Technique using Bash language syntax to execute multiple commands within a single parameter bypassing space or special character filters.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique using braces in Bash to split or merge command segments and evade space/newline filtering.</data>
