  <data key="d2">A purpose-designed object that encapsulates only the fields allowed for a specific API endpoint.&lt;SEP&gt;An architectural pattern used to prevent mass assignment by designing a DTO containing only editable fields and transparently mapping to internal models without direct binding.</data>
