<node id="Sensitive Information">
  <data key="d0">Sensitive Information</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Data with privacy, security, or business value stored within the application context.&lt;SEP&gt;Any data displayed to the user that must be protected from unauthorized access, including address, credit card details, Social Security Number, or username.&lt;SEP&gt;Data stored in the cloud that becomes exposed if unauthorized access is possible due to misconfiguration.&lt;SEP&gt;Concrete type of information transmitted over the network that may include credentials, PII, credit card numbers, health records, etc.&lt;SEP&gt;Target data including network diagrams, configuration files, usernames, passwords, private keys, or non-public application versions.&lt;SEP&gt;A category of data that includes, but is not limited to, API keys, internal IP addresses, admin routes, and hardcoded credentials which may be leaked.&lt;SEP&gt;Confidential data such as usernames, passwords, internal IPs, or SQL queries accidentally included in source code or comments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-536e7409d2b781ede98f0ff8ef399eed-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-536e7409d2b781ede98f0ff8ef399eed-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-09090bb3d2c328e6a03a33f47fdb7c40-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5a256f4ddf984161f5cbf651e65af470-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8b308a52fdeb6c7f9a9a2dce9ca1cae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-355889046c6513bd655625fa66e3f822-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-355889046c6513bd655625fa66e3f822-chunk-000</data>
