  <data key="d2">Attacker possessing client_id can forge consent if consent page (e.g., `/u/consent`) is vulnerable to clickjacking.</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-athz-05-1-methodology.md</data>
