  <data key="d3">doc-aa5c9321922fff53a8b5093aeb86d6b2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d2">The listener function is attached to the form element to handle submission events and process input data.</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-clnt-01-1-methodology.md</data>
