  <data key="d0">Session Cookie Disclosure</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackGoal</data>
  <data key="d2">Revealing session identifiers that enable session hijacking or impersonation of authenticated users.&lt;SEP&gt;Potential result where the injected content reveals a user's authentication cookie to an attacker.</data>
