  <data key="d0">Malicious JavaScript Payload</data>
  <data key="d1">PayloadPattern</data>
  <data key="d2">Reusable malicious JavaScript code (or inline code snippets using `\n` separators and encoding evasion techniques) designed to violate application input validation and execute in the client's browser.</data>
