  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A testing step wherein an OPTIONS method request is sent in advance of a non-simple cross-origin request to evaluate allowed methods and headers before execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A background, optional request sent by the browser to check allowed methods, headers, and credentials before the actual request.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d89410974592b19e283a445bd3ea68aa-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d89410974592b19e283a445bd3ea68aa-chunk-000</data>
