  <data key="d0">Unvalidated `asfunction` parameter</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness in Flash Player versions where the `asfunction` method allows arbitrary ActionScript code execution if the input lacks restrictions or allow-list validation.</data>
