  <data key="d0">Cross-Site WebSocket Hijacking (CSWH)</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackGoal</data>
  <data key="d2">Gaining unauthorized WebSocket connection from untrusted origins to perform actions on a target application across different domains.</data>
