  <data key="d5">1785577988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vue.js">
  <data key="d0">Vue.js</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A progressive JavaScript framework for building user interfaces, using templates that can be vulnerable to injection if insecurely processed.&lt;SEP&gt;A progressive frontend JavaScript framework that includes a template syntax and a runtime compiler (in older versions); sensitive use of `v-html` creates injection risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A progressive JavaScript framework for building user interfaces.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-clnt-15-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785577988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alpine.js">
  <data key="d0">Alpine.js</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A minimal JavaScript framework that directly manipulates the DOM using data bindings and attributes without a traditional template engine.&lt;SEP&gt;A minimal JavaScript framework that applies attributes starting with `x-`; improper use can lead to syntax injection if user input affects template interpolation.&lt;SEP&gt;A lightweight JavaScript framework that allows dynamic rendering based on DOM attributes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-000</data>
