  <data key="d0">Angular 1.x sandbox</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A target condition in older Angular versions where a template engine runs code within a sandbox environment that can potentially be bypassed via complex payloads.</data>
