<node id="Verbose Error Disclosure">
  <data key="d0">Verbose Error Disclosure</data>
  <data key="d1">preconditionenvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Verbose Error Disclosure refers to a security condition in which an application returns detailed error messages to the client or user, often exposing internal system or application information. This occurs when the system processes unexpected input, particularly in production environments, and responds with error responses that include technical details such as stack traces, file paths, database queries, or internal logic. These disclosures may reveal sensitive information about the backend architecture, system state, or implementation specifics, which can be exploited by attackers. The exposure of such information aids in the development of attacks and facilitates vulnerability discovery, making it a critical concern in application security. This condition is commonly observed when error handling mechanisms are not properly configured to sanitize or abstract error messages before presenting them to external users. As a result, Verbose Error Disclosure poses a significant risk by providing attackers with insights that can be used to compromise the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7e4dbed88f64fa7cde685ea3eeba6062-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7e4dbed88f64fa7cde685ea3eeba6062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7d6b66fa87709205e7e043782f3a891-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7d6b66fa87709205e7e043782f3a891-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-conf-05-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-errh-01-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-d1ffa3e33fee59c7.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1787995444</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Verbose Error Disclosure</data>
</node>
