<node id="RFC 7231">
  <data key="d0">RFC 7231</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">The official IETF RFC document that defines the main valid HTTP request methods or verbs.&lt;SEP&gt;A Request for Comments document specifying the semantics and requirements for the HTTP/1.1 protocol.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4fc774259228cd414282425d0a281e37-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc774259228cd414282425d0a281e37-chunk-000</data>
