<node id="Man-in-the-Middle Attack">
  <data key="d0">Man-in-the-Middle Attack</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Eavesdropping or modification attack where an adversary intercepts communication between users and servers without detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e3d35387f319064504857847281b5d15-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-conf-07-methodology.md</data>
