  <data key="d0">Absence of HSTS header</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e3d35387f319064504857847281b5d15-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d2">Without HSTS, browsers cannot distinguish secure vs. insecure connections, making MITM attacks feasible.</data>
