  <data key="d0">External Resource (deprovisioned)</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A target condition where an external service such as GitHub Pages, AWS S3, or Heroku has been deleted or expired, leaving the DNS resource record unclaimed for takeover.</data>
