  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A reconnaissance technique used to identify the type and version of a web server by eliciting specific server responses during communication.&lt;SEP&gt;A method of identifying the type and version of a running web server by analyzing its responses and behaviors.&lt;SEP&gt;Probing or identifying web server type via information gathering methods to determine SSI support.</data>
