  <data key="d0">HTTP Response</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A structured HTTP response document including headers and body returned to a client.&lt;SEP&gt;Message sent from server to client containing status codes, headers, and content related to the processed request.&lt;SEP&gt;The data returned by the server in response to a client's request, including headers, status codes, and payload content.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-79636d7f9a295c3fa17a27c773d950df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d9258074adf66922ee55cf68a3d1139-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d9258074adf66922ee55cf68a3d1139-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2ab4b970856023b5f961a9117891837-chunk-000</data>
