<node id="Apache">
  <data key="d0">Apache</data>
  <data key="d1">technologystack</data>
  <data key="d2">Apache is a widely used open-source web server software that serves HTTP requests and is employed to host websites and serve web content. It functions as a core component of a web server technology stack, operating on the target system to deliver web-based applications and resources. Apache is relevant to the target environment and is often integral to the infrastructure that supports web-based services. As a robust and scalable solution, it is commonly used in both standard web hosting and specialized environments where reliable content delivery is required. The technology stack involving Apache may also include additional components that support the hosting and operation of web applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-79636d7f9a295c3fa17a27c773d950df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-info-02-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ea557e757697285d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-045067d746e8d66c.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-db59b660c03f0d7d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
