<node id="Vulnerability Scanner">
  <data key="d0">Vulnerability Scanner</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated software tool used to identify misconfigurations like directory browsing in a target infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool used to scan web infrastructure to identify potential attack surfaces, discover hidden applications, or detect misconfigurations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-006</data>
