  <data key="d0">Port Scanner Tool</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A software utility that probes IP addresses across all TCP/UDP ports to detect open services.Description: An automated tool capable of scanning every port on an IP range to identify running services, commonly using options like `-sV` for version detection on open ports.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-info-04-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785580147</data>
