  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A TCP/IP port number in the 64k range other than the standard 80 or 443, where web applications might unexpectedly be listening.Description: A potential target port condition for discovering hidden web applications not bound to conventional HTTP or HTTPS defaults.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-info-04-methodology.md</data>
