  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">Known exact URL path or address required to access applications not linked from published pages.Description: The attacker already possesses knowledge of the specific, hidden URL structure needed to reach the Target Application directly because they know it exists or have obtained it (e.g., `app1.example.com:8080/admin`).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-002</data>
