  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A persistent reflected web page injection vulnerability enabling execution of attacker-provided script in user browsers.&lt;SEP&gt;Execution of malicious JavaScript in the browser of a victim user, typically to steal session tokens, deface pages, or hijack browsers.</data>
