  <data key="d0">SQL injection</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">An attack objective to gain unauthorized access or retrieve/modify confidential data through malicious SQL queries.&lt;SEP&gt;Vulnerability class where user-supplied input executes unintended SQL commands due to lack of constraints or sanitization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-df80c9fe91c3765dc83d86ba6565a823-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-240337c7993893650c60e2b94d64ba3c-chunk-003</data>
