</node>
<node id="sleep() function">
  <data key="d0">sleep() function</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">An alternative timing attack action using `SLEEP()` for blind SQL injection enumeration, available in MySQL 5.0.x and later.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-df80c9fe91c3765dc83d86ba6565a823-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-05-2-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785581176</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
