  <data key="d0">Time-Based Blind SQL Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackGoal</data>
  <data key="d2">An SQL injection technique that identifies data values by measuring the time taken for different boolean queries to respond.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific attack objective to extract data by sending crafted queries that induce delays based on response times.</data>
