  <data key="d2">A form of information leakage where the timing or behavior of responses conveys data when explicit error messages are suppressed.&lt;SEP&gt;Establishing a hidden communication channel inside an environment where detection is difficult, using techniques such as time-based SQL queries or debug.exe execution artifacts.</data>
