  <data key="d0">Output Validation</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b515367113bce44cf3564abc5019508d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d2">Encoding data before rendering can prevent stored cross-site scripting attacks from executing malicious JavaScript.</data>
