  <data key="d2">A weakness class where web application frameworks auto-bind request parameters to model properties without explicit intent checks.&lt;SEP&gt;A target weakness allowing user-supplied input to alter unintended object attributes during object creation or update operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness where web applications automatically bind all user input to object properties without proper restrictions.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness that occurs when an application automatically maps user-provided input to model or entity attributes without proper validation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-002</data>
