<node id="Mass Assignment">
  <data key="d0">Mass Assignment</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness where web application frameworks incorrectly map all user-submitted request fields to model object properties, allowing modification of sensitive fields that should not be exposed for external updates.&lt;SEP&gt;Achieving elevated privileges or modifying sensitive object properties through unrestricted input field binding.&lt;SEP&gt;A security testing technique that exploits arbitrary object field modification through unvalidated input binding.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffa6824f346bf84b31bce21c39580284-chunk-002</data>
