  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Spreadsheet application that may parse and execute formulas contained in CSV cell values depending on context and post-save behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;A spreadsheet application known to interpret certain cell contents as formulas when a CSV file is opened and may lose prevention after saving/reopening.</data>
