<node id="Prototype Pollution Vulnerability">
  <data key="d0">Prototype Pollution Vulnerability</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A security weakness where an attacker can modify the prototype chain of an object, potentially adding malicious properties inherited by all child objects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0afc271ddfef476dba107d5eebef758e-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-22-methodology.md</data>
