<node id="Attacker-Controlled Object">
  <data key="d0">Attacker-Controlled Object</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An object provided by the attacker during input submission, designed to include malicious keys such as `__proto__`.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0afc271ddfef476dba107d5eebef758e-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-22-methodology.md</data>
