<node id="Object.prototype">
  <data key="d0">Object.prototype</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">The prototype root object in JavaScript that once polluted is inherited by all objects in the runtime.&lt;SEP&gt;The object prototype object in JavaScript used to define default properties and behavior for all instances of `Object`.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0afc271ddfef476dba107d5eebef758e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0afc271ddfef476dba107d5eebef758e-chunk-002</data>
