  <data key="d5">1785583537</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SameSite">
  <data key="d0">SameSite</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">The attribute that determines how and when a cookie is sent across different domains (Strict, Lax, None values described for session management tests).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secure">
  <data key="d0">Secure</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A cookie attribute that enforces cookie transmission only over encrypted (HTTPS) connections, reducing eavesdropping.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Path">
  <data key="d0">Path</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">The URL path value for a cookie, determining under which directory path within a domain the cookie is valid and sent.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SameSite=Strict">
  <data key="d0">SameSite=Strict</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific SameSite cookie attribute value that restricts cookie transmission to first-party context only per browser URL bar.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SameSite=Lax">
  <data key="d0">SameSite=Lax</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A SameSite cookie attribute value that is less restrictive than Strict, sending the cookie with first-party requests even from third-party source links.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SameSite=None">
  <data key="d0">SameSite=None</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A SameSite cookie attribute value that sends the cookie in all contexts (cross-site included), mandating the Secure attribute otherwise ignored by modern browsers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="__Host-SID">
  <data key="d0">__Host-SID</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An example cookie name composed of the __Host- prefix and session identifier for secure session management testing scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HttpOnly">
  <data key="d0">HttpOnly</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A cookie attribute that prevents client-side JavaScript from accessing the cookie, mitigating XSS threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-sess-02-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785583397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secure Attribute">
  <data key="d0">Secure Attribute</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">Cookie attribute that restricts transmission to secure (`HTTPS`) connections only.&lt;SEP&gt;A cookie characteristic where the Secure flag instructs browsers to only send cookies over HTTPS.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-specified cookie attribute that restricts transmission of the cookie over unencrypted HTTP connections.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0b5d4912d9dca5c18a19c922b0e93be4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2ab4b970856023b5f961a9117891837-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2ab4b970856023b5f961a9117891837-chunk-001</data>
