<node id="Reachable Login Workflow">
  <data key="d0">Reachable Login Workflow</data>
  <data key="d1">preconditionenvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Reachable Login Workflow refers to a target condition in which a login workflow is accessible, functional, and capable of interaction, particularly from the perspective of an attacker. This condition encompasses the accessibility of the login interface or process over a network, ensuring that it can be reached and interacted with from the attacker's network or position. The login workflow must be operational and usable, allowing the attacker to engage with it, potentially to test authentication mechanisms, attempt to authenticate, or exploit vulnerabilities. Accessibility may be defined in terms of network reachability, where the login workflow is available over the network and can be accessed from the attacker's location. The workflow must be both reachable and functional, meaning it is not only accessible but also responsive and capable of processing inputs. In this context, the login workflow may be interacted with during an attack, enabling the attacker to attempt authentication, exploit weaknesses, or test system defenses. The term emphasizes that the login workflow is not only accessible but also usable and potentially exploitable, highlighting its relevance in security assessments and penetration testing scenarios. This condition is critical for evaluating the security posture of a system, as it indicates whether an attacker can access and potentially compromise the authentication process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e8b98451fa828a77a410acce1592cf2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-043536b1d64220258b6e91d8d3fd0aab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-00