<node id="Uploaded Files Are Web Served">
  <data key="d0">Uploaded Files Are Web Served</data>
  <data key="d1">preconditionenvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A target condition where uploaded files are served via web server.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where uploaded files are served via a web server.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where uploaded files are served via the web server.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where uploaded files are accessible via a web server.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where uploaded files are served by the web server and accessible via HTTP.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1787994730</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Uploaded Files Are Web Served</data>
</node>
<node id="JWT Authentication Flow">
  <data key="d0">JWT Authentication Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">preconditionenvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">JWT Authentication Flow is a target condition where the system employs JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) for authentication and session management. This process involves the issuance and validation of JWT tokens as part of the authentication mechanism, enabling users to authenticate and maintain session state without requiring repeated credential input. JWTs are used to verify the identity of users and are typically issued by an authentication server upon successful login. These tokens are then presented by the client in subsequent requests to access protected resources. The authentication flow relies on the secure generation and validation of JWTs, which contain encoded claims such as user identity and permissions. While this approach streamlines stateless authentication and supports scalability, it also introduces potential security risks. JWT-based authentication can be exploited if the tokens are improperly validated, leading to vulnerabilities such as token forgery, manipulation, or replay attacks. Issues may arise when the system fails to enforce strong signing algorithms, does not validate token expiration, or improperly handles token storage. Additionally, the use of JWTs for session management means that compromised tokens can grant unauthorized access, particularly if the system does not implement proper revocation mechanisms. Therefore, while JWT Authentication Flow enhances efficiency and reduces server-side session storage, it requires robust implementation practices to mitigate security threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-00