<node id="WinRM Credential Login">
  <data key="d0">WinRM Credential Login</data>
  <data key="d1">attacktechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">WinRM Credential Login is an action that involves using valid credentials to authenticate via Windows Remote Management (WinRM), a protocol designed for remote management of systems. This process enables users or systems to log in to a target machine using provided credentials, thereby gaining access to the system. It is commonly employed for remote administration tasks, such as executing commands, managing configurations, or retrieving system information. The action may be initiated to achieve various objectives, including system access, lateral movement within a network, or establishing a remote session. While it is a legitimate administrative technique, it can also be exploited by attackers to gain unauthorized access, particularly when strong authentication mechanisms are not in place. The use of valid credentials is essential for successful authentication, and the action typically involves attempting to log in through the WinRM service to establish a secure, remote connection. This technique is widely recognized in both operational and security contexts, especially in environments where remote management is required.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-938bc49bb5da258f.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-16c3d9d4e9cc3637.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-bae40e62361a8519.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md</data>
