<node id="JWT Token Forgery">
  <data key="d0">JWT Token Forgery</data>
  <data key="d1">attacktechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">JWT Token Forgery is an action or technique that involves creating, modifying, or manipulating JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) to gain unauthorized access, bypass authentication, or exploit weaknesses in authentication and authorization mechanisms. This activity typically exploits vulnerabilities such as weak signing algorithms, insecure secret keys, or improper token validation. By forging or altering JWT tokens—often by modifying claims or exploiting weak secrets—attackers can impersonate legitimate users, escalate privileges, or bypass security controls. JWT Token Forgery may also be used in security testing to identify and assess vulnerabilities in systems that rely on JWTs for authentication. The technique can be leveraged to gain unauthorized access to sensitive data or functionalities, and in some cases, it may be used to exploit broader issues like Local File Inclusion or credential exposure. While primarily associated with malicious intent, it is also employed as a testing action to evaluate the robustness of token validation processes. The core objective of JWT Token Forgery is to compromise the integrity of the token-based authentication system, allowing unauthorized entities to access protected resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-00