<node id="Coerced Authentication">
  <data key="d0">Coerced Authentication</data>
  <data key="d1">vulnerabilityclass</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness class where authentication is forced or manipulated.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authentication is coerced through external means.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authentication is coerced through indirect means.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authentication is coerced through malicious input.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authentication is forced to a malicious service.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authentication can be forced or coerced by an attacker.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000</data>
