<node id="Client-Side Authorization">
  <data key="d0">Client-Side Authorization</data>
  <data key="d1">attackgoal</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness class where authorization checks are performed on the client side, allowing bypass.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authorization checks occur on the client side.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authorization checks are performed on the client side.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authorization checks are performed on the client side, allowing manipulation.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where authorization checks are performed client-side.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic goal where an attacker bypasses client-side authorization checks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001</data>
