<node id="Exposed Git Repository">
  <data key="d0">Exposed Git Repository</data>
  <data key="d1">preconditionenvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Exposed Git Repository is a target condition in which a Git repository is publicly accessible, exposed, or available on the internet without proper access controls. This state allows anyone, including attackers, to view, clone, and review the repository's contents. The exposure typically includes the full source code, version history, and potentially sensitive information such as configuration files, credentials, or internal documentation. As a result, the repository may be vulnerable to exploitation, data leakage, or reverse engineering. The condition is often identified during security assessments or reconnaissance phases, where the public accessibility of the repository enables unauthorized access to the project's development history and codebase. This exposure can occur due to misconfigurations, improper deployment, or accidental publication of the repository. The presence of an exposed Git repository represents a significant security risk, particularly when it contains confidential or proprietary data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
