<node id="Insecure Deserialization">
  <data key="d0">Insecure Deserialization</data>
  <data key="d1">vulnerabilityclass</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness class where deserialization of untrusted data can lead to code execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where deserialization of untrusted data leads to code execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where untrusted data is deserialized without proper validation.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where deserialization of untrusted data can lead to arbitrary code execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where deserialization is not properly validated.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where deserialization processes do not validate or sanitize input.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-001</data>
