<node id="Name-Based Virtual Host Routing">
  <data key="d0">Name-Based Virtual Host Routing</data>
  <data key="d1">preconditionenvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Name-Based Virtual Host Routing is a target condition in web server configurations where routing decisions are made based on the hostname specified in incoming HTTP requests. This mechanism enables the server to direct traffic to the appropriate virtual host by examining the host header within the HTTP request. The hostname can be extracted from various parts of the request, such as the Host header or the hostname field in the request line, depending on the server implementation. This routing method supports host discovery, allowing servers to identify and serve content for multiple domains or subdomains using a single IP address. It is commonly used in environments where multiple websites are hosted on the same server, facilitating efficient resource utilization and simplified management. The process relies on the server’s ability to match the requested hostname against configured virtual hosts, ensuring that users are directed to the correct site based on the domain they are accessing. This approach is fundamental to modern web hosting and is widely supported across web server software.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md</data>
