<node id="Credentialed Login Access">
  <data key="d0">Credentialed Login Access</data>
  <data key="d1">attackercapability</data>
  <data key="d2">Credentialed Login Access refers to the capability of an entity, typically an attacker, to gain access to a system or target by using valid login credentials. This access is achieved through the successful authentication process, where the attacker provides legitimate usernames and passwords or other valid authentication factors. The ability is often described as a reusable access condition, meaning it can be leveraged multiple times if the credentials remain valid and unrevoked. It is commonly associated with an attacker's operational capability to log in to a target system, access resources, or perform actions within the system environment. This form of access may be exploited in various attack scenarios, including credential stuffing, phishing, or the reuse of compromised credentials. The condition is not limited to a specific system or platform but applies broadly across digital environments where authentication is required. In some contexts, it is also referred to as an operational ability to log in using valid credentials, emphasizing its role in ongoing or repeated access. The presence of valid credentials is a prerequisite for this access, and the capability is often exploited when such credentials are obtained through breaches, insider threats, or weak security practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
