<edge source="PHP" target="Executable Upload Webshell">
  <data key="d8">13.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique known as (Executable Upload Webshell, PHP) is a cyberattack method that leverages PHP as a core component of the technology stack. It is specifically designed to target PHP-based applications and environments, exploiting the vulnerabilities inherent in PHP-driven web systems. This technique involves the upload of malicious executable files that can be executed within the PHP runtime environment, allowing an attacker to gain unauthorized access or control over the targeted system. The use of PHP is central to the functionality of this technique, as it enables the execution of arbitrary code on the server. The technique is relevant to any system or application that relies on PHP for server-side processing, making it a significant threat in environments where PHP is used for web development. The attack typically requires the presence of a file upload functionality that does not adequately validate or sanitize the uploaded files, allowing the webshell to be deployed and executed.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is relevant to the PHP technology stack.&lt;SEP&gt;The PHP technology stack supports the executable upload webshell technique.</data>
  <data key="d10">is relevant to,relevant to,supports,targets,uses</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002</data>
