<edge source="XML Parser" target="XML Injection">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Tests are designed to exploit how the parser handles malicious XML when parsed by the target technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The entity is a weakness in the XML processing engine that fails to reject malformed or hostile input.&lt;SEP&gt;Abuses parser behavior to resolve external entities when input validation is insufficient.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection technique aims to manipulate the vulnerable application through misinterpretation of input by a flawed XML parser.&lt;SEP&gt;The XML parser is the target mechanism that may be exploited if injection is successful.</data>
