<edge source="Command Output" target="Executable Upload Webshell">
  <data key="d8">12.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Command Output-Executable Upload Webshell is a technique in cybersecurity that involves the upload of an executable file to a web server through a webshell, enabling remote command execution. This technique is characterized by the generation of command output as a signal, which can be used to confirm the success of the operation. The command output serves as an indicator of the technique’s success, providing feedback on whether the executable upload was completed successfully. Multiple descriptions emphasize that command output is a critical signal in detecting and validating the execution of this technique. The presence of command output indicates that the uploaded executable has been executed, thereby confirming the successful deployment of the webshell. This output may include system information, file listings, or other data generated by the executed command, reflecting the system's response to the uploaded payload. As such, monitoring command output is a key method for identifying the presence and success of an executable upload webshell. The technique relies on the ability to generate and interpret such output, making it a significant consideration in intrusion detection and incident response.</data>
  <data key="d10">produces, indicates, indicated by, generates</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
