<edge source="Command Output" target="SQL Injection File Read">
  <data key="d8">17.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation Command Output-SQL Injection File Read refers to the observable signal generated by a command output that indicates the result or success of a SQL injection file read technique. This technique involves exploiting a SQL injection vulnerability to read files from a target system, and the command output serves as a key indicator of whether the attack was successful. The command output can manifest as data retrieved from the targeted file, such as file contents or system information, which confirms that the SQL injection was executed properly and that file access was achieved. In some cases, the command output may also reveal a vulnerability in the system, suggesting that the SQL injection file read technique could be leveraged. The presence of such output provides a clear, observable signal of the technique’s outcome, whether it is successful, partially successful, or indicative of an exploitable weakness. This relation is primarily used in cybersecurity contexts to detect and analyze the aftermath of SQL injection attacks aimed at unauthorized file access.</data>
  <data key="d10">indicates result of, can indicate, generates, indicated by, indicates</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
