<edge source="Authenticated Session" target="JWT Token Forgery">
  <data key="d8">18.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Authenticated Session-JWT Token Forgery refers to a cybersecurity technique that involves exploiting an authenticated session to forge JSON Web Tokens (JWTs). The technique requires an authenticated session to be effective, as the presence of such a session is a prerequisite for initiating the forgery process. In some cases, the technique can produce or establish an authenticated session on the target system, thereby enabling the subsequent manipulation of JWT tokens. This capability is essential for the technique to function, as it allows the attacker to leverage an existing authenticated state to create or modify tokens. The technique supports and enables authenticated session capabilities, which are necessary for testing and executing JWT token forgery. While the primary focus is on exploiting an authenticated session to achieve forgery, the technique may also be used to establish such a session as part of the attack workflow. Overall, the effectiveness of the technique is contingent upon the presence or creation of an authenticated session, which serves as a foundational element for the successful execution of JWT token forgery.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires an authenticated session.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires an authenticated session.</data>
  <data key="d10">can establish,enables,establishes,produces,requires,supports</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000</data>
