<edge source="Credentials" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d8">17.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Credentials-SSRF Localhost Probing is a technique that can produce credentials as an artifact. This method involves exploiting Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerabilities to probe localhost, often enabling unauthorized access to internal systems or services. Through this probing, the technique may extract or generate credentials, which are then captured as a data artifact. The process highlights how SSRF can be leveraged not only for reconnaissance but also for harvesting sensitive authentication information. The credentials artifact is specifically generated as a result of the localhost probing activity, making it a key output of this attack method. While the technique is primarily associated with security testing and threat modeling, it underscores the risks of improperly secured internal network interfaces. The artifact may include authentication tokens, usernames, passwords, or other access credentials that are exposed due to the SSRF vulnerability. This behavior is consistently documented across multiple descriptions, emphasizing the direct link between the technique and the production of credential artifacts.</data>
  <data key="d10">produced, can produce, produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000</data>
