<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Credential Exposure">
  <data key="d8">13.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Credential Exposure-Source Code Review is a technique that involves testing or exploiting vulnerabilities related to credential exposure through source code review. This approach focuses on identifying and leveraging weaknesses in software code where sensitive credentials, such as passwords, API keys, or tokens, may be improperly stored, hardcoded, or transmitted. The technique is specifically designed to detect and exploit instances where credentials are exposed within the source code, either through insecure coding practices or inadequate access controls. By analyzing the source code, the method aims to uncover potential security flaws that could allow unauthorized access to systems or data. It is primarily used in security assessments and penetration testing to evaluate the resilience of software against credential-based attacks. The technique targets various forms of credential exposure vulnerabilities, including but not limited to hardcoded credentials, insecure logging, or improper handling of authentication tokens. In some contexts, it may also be referred to as a method that exploits credential exposure weaknesses, emphasizing its focus on identifying and leveraging such flaws. Overall, Credential Exposure-Source Code Review serves as a critical component in identifying and mitigating security risks associated with the improper management of credentials in software systems.</data>
  <data key="d10">targets, exploits, tests or exploits</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4c91a7e4da4eea3a.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
