<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Privilege Escalation Path">
  <data key="d8">10.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Privilege Escalation Path-Source Code Review refers to a technique within the context of cybersecurity that involves analyzing source code to identify and exploit vulnerabilities that enable a privilege escalation path. This technique requires a privilege escalation path, meaning it depends on the existence of a pathway through which an attacker can elevate their access rights within a system. It supports the achievement of privilege escalation by enabling the establishment of such a path, thereby facilitating unauthorized access to higher-level privileges. The technique can support the broader attack goal of privilege escalation, allowing an attacker to gain elevated permissions beyond those initially granted. Additionally, it requires a capability related to privilege escalation path, emphasizing the need for specific skills or tools to execute this method. Source Code Review, as a standalone capability, can establish the attacker's ability to identify and leverage vulnerabilities that lead to a privilege escalation path. This process is critical in assessing software security, as it enables the detection of flaws that could be exploited to escalate privileges, ultimately compromising system integrity.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, supports achieving, enables</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
