<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Shell Access">
  <data key="d8">14.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Shell Access-Source Code Review is a technique that relates to the acquisition or support of shell access within a cybersecurity context. The technique enables shell access, meaning it can be used to establish or facilitate a command-line interface on a target system. It also requires shell access, indicating that prior access may be necessary to execute the technique effectively. Additionally, the technique supports shell access, suggesting it can assist in maintaining or expanding such access once established. Source Code Review is identified as a method that can establish the attacker capability of Shell Access, implying that analyzing source code may reveal vulnerabilities or backdoors enabling unauthorized shell access. The technique can produce shell access on the target system, highlighting its potential to create a foothold. Furthermore, it can support the attacker's capability to gain shell access, reinforcing its role in offensive operations. The technique requires a shell access capability, which may refer to the prerequisite conditions for its execution. Overall, Shell Access-Source Code Review is a process that either enables, supports, or depends on shell access, and is instrumental in establishing or enhancing an attacker’s control over a system through code analysis.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, produces, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d12">source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-16c3d9d4e9cc3637.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
