<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Read Sensitive Data">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Read Sensitive Data-Source Code Review is a technique that supports the goal of reading sensitive data. This technique is primarily associated with source code review processes, where the analysis of code is conducted to identify vulnerabilities or weaknesses that could enable unauthorized access to sensitive information. The technique supports achieving the objective of reading sensitive data, and it can be employed during security testing to assess whether an application or system is susceptible to data exposure. It also enables the testing for the ability to read sensitive data, helping to evaluate the effectiveness of security controls. Additionally, the technique is recognized as a method that can support the attack goal of reading sensitive data, highlighting its relevance in both defensive and offensive cybersecurity contexts. Overall, Read Sensitive Data-Source Code Review is a critical component in identifying and mitigating risks related to data confidentiality through the examination of software code.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, supports achieving, supports testing for, can support</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-829d6e7cad18eac1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md</data>
