<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Execute Code">
  <data key="d8">12.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Execute Code-Source Code Review is a technique that supports the execution of arbitrary code, often as part of an attack strategy. This technique is primarily utilized to identify vulnerabilities within source code that could be exploited to achieve code execution. It enables attackers to analyze software code for weaknesses such as buffer overflows, insecure function calls, or improper input validation, which may allow malicious code to be run on a target system. The process involves reviewing the source code to determine whether it contains exploitable patterns or insecure implementations that could lead to unauthorized code execution. This technique is often employed during security assessments or penetration testing to evaluate the risk of code execution vulnerabilities. It supports both the direct goal of executing code and the broader objective of testing for such capabilities within a system. In some contexts, Source Code Review is specifically linked to the attack goal of Execute Code, indicating its relevance in threat modeling and offensive security operations. The technique is instrumental in identifying and validating potential pathways to compromise a system by leveraging vulnerabilities in the codebase. While the focus is on identifying exploitable flaws, the ultimate aim is to achieve code execution, either for testing purposes or as part of an actual attack. This technique may be used in both defensive and offensive cybersecurity contexts, where understanding the code's behavior is essential to either prevent or exploit execution vulnerabilities.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, supports testing for, can support, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
