<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Escalate Privileges">
  <data key="d8">13.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Escalate Privileges-Source Code Review is a technique that supports the goal of escalating privileges within a system. This approach involves analyzing source code to identify vulnerabilities or misconfigurations that could be exploited to gain elevated access rights. The technique is specifically designed to test for privilege escalation scenarios, enabling attackers to achieve unauthorized administrative or higher-level privileges. It aligns with the broader attack objective of escalating privileges and can be used to assess the security posture of software systems. By reviewing the source code, potential weaknesses such as insecure function calls, improper access controls, or flawed authentication mechanisms can be uncovered. The technique supports both the testing and the actual achievement of privilege escalation, making it a valuable method in penetration testing and security assessments. It is particularly relevant in environments where source code is accessible or where code review is a standard security practice. The technique is explicitly linked to the attack goal of Escalate Privileges, indicating its targeted use in cyberattack scenarios aimed at gaining unauthorized control over systems.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, can support, supports testing for, supports attack goal, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
