<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Config File">
  <data key="d8">12.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Config File-Source Code Review is a technique that involves analyzing source code to generate configuration files as artifacts. This process can produce config files, which are often used to define settings or parameters for software systems. The technique may result in the creation of configuration files as output artifacts, and it is capable of generating these files either as standalone entities or as part of a broader development or deployment workflow. The produced config files may be referred to as config file artifacts, emphasizing their role as tangible outputs of the review process. The term "Config File" is sometimes used as a specific artifact name, and the technique is recognized as a method through which such files can be derived from source code analysis. The production of these files is a consistent outcome of the technique, indicating its utility in automating or facilitating configuration management.</data>
  <data key="d10">can produce, produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
