<edge source="Source Code Review" target="URL Userinfo Confusion Payload">
  <data key="d8">14.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The (Source Code Review, URL Userinfo Confusion Payload) relation refers to the use of a specific payload pattern—known as the URL userinfo confusion payload—in the context of source code review techniques. This payload pattern is employed as part of a methodological approach within source code reviews, where it serves as a mechanism to identify or exploit potential vulnerabilities related to the handling of URL userinfo components. The technique leverages the confusion that can arise from improperly parsed or validated userinfo fields in URLs, which may lead to security issues such as injection attacks or unauthorized access. The payload is specifically designed to test how source code processes and interprets these components, particularly when they are embedded in URLs. Multiple descriptions confirm that the URL userinfo confusion payload is not merely a theoretical concept but a practical pattern integrated into source code review practices. The technique uses this payload pattern to evaluate the robustness of code in parsing and validating URLs, ensuring that such components are handled securely. The consistency across descriptions indicates that this relation is focused on a well-defined methodological interaction between the source code review process and the exploitation or detection of URL userinfo-related vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The payload pattern is used in the source code review technique.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique uses the URL userinfo confusion payload pattern.</data>
  <data key="d10">targets,used in,uses</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
