<edge source="Source Code Review" target="Python Web Stack">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Python Web Stack-Source Code Review refers to a technique or process focused on the analysis and evaluation of source code within the context of the Python Web Stack. This technique is relevant to the Python Web Stack, a technology stack commonly used for developing web applications using Python. The approach targets applications built with the Python Web Stack, leveraging its components such as web frameworks (e.g., Django, Flask), web servers, databases, and related tools. It involves examining the source code to assess security, performance, maintainability, and adherence to best practices specific to Python-based web development. The technique utilizes the Python Web Stack as its environment or target, meaning it operates within or applies to systems constructed using this stack. It is particularly applicable to applications that rely on the full ecosystem of the Python Web Stack, including backend logic, API development, and web service integration. The process may include identifying vulnerabilities, code inefficiencies, or architectural inconsistencies inherent in Python web applications. Overall, Python Web Stack-Source Code Review is a targeted method for ensuring code quality and security in applications developed using this technology stack.</data>
  <data key="d10">targets, uses, relevant to, is relevant to</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
