<edge source="LDAP-Backed Query Path" target="WinRM Credential Login">
  <data key="d8">8.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (LDAP-Backed Query Path, WinRM Credential Login) describes a conditional dependency between two technical mechanisms in a system environment. WinRM Credential Login is applicable when an LDAP-Backed Query Path is present. This means that the successful execution of WinRM Credential Login relies on the existence of a query path that is backed by Lightweight Directory Access Protocol (LDAP). The presence of such a path enables the authentication and credential handling processes required for WinRM (Windows Remote Management) to function properly within a directory-enabled infrastructure. Multiple descriptions emphasize that the applicability of the technique hinges on the existence of an LDAP-backed query path, indicating that this condition is a prerequisite for the use of WinRM Credential Login. The consistency across the descriptions suggests that this relationship is well-defined and critical in environments where directory services are used for authentication and access control. The relation underscores the integration of directory-based query mechanisms with remote management protocols, ensuring secure and structured credential handling in enterprise systems.</data>
  <data key="d10">applies when,is applicable when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d12">source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-16c3d9d4e9cc3637.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-bae40e62361a8519.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md</data>
  <data key="d13">1787913607</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
