<edge source="Boolean Response Difference" target="SQL Injection File Read">
  <data key="d8">9.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique known as SQL Injection File Read is applicable when a boolean response difference is present, exists, or is observed. This condition arises when the system returns different responses based on the input provided, indicating a detectable variation in behavior. Such differences are typically observed in the form of distinct outcomes—such as success or failure, visible content changes, or altered server responses—triggered by specific inputs. The presence of a boolean response difference is a critical prerequisite for the technique, as it allows an attacker to infer information about the underlying database structure or system configuration. This inference is made possible by exploiting the system's reaction to crafted queries, where the response difference confirms the validity of certain conditions. The technique relies on the detectability of these response differences, which may manifest in various forms, including altered page content, error messages, or timing variations. The ability to distinguish between true and false conditions through such responses enables the extraction of data, including file contents, through a series of iterative queries. The method is particularly effective in environments where the application does not properly sanitize user inputs, allowing SQL injection attacks to succeed. In summary, SQL Injection File Read operates under the condition that a boolean response difference is detectable, enabling an attacker to leverage this difference to extract sensitive information from the target system.</data>
  <data key="d10">applies when,requires</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
