  <data key="d9">The technique is applicable when a reachable login workflow exists.&lt;SEP&gt;SSRF Localhost Probing is applicable when Reachable Login Workflow is present.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when a reachable login workflow is present.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when a login workflow is reachable.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when the precondition Reachable Login Workflow is present.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique applies when a reachable login workflow is present.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when the login workflow is reachable.</data>
