<edge source="Reachable Login Workflow" target="SQL Injection File Read">
  <data key="d8">12.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Reachable Login Workflow-SQL Injection File Read is a technique that relies on the presence of a reachable login workflow as a prerequisite. The technique is applicable when a login workflow is accessible, meaning it can be reached from the attacker's position, such as through a publicly exposed interface or an unsecured entry point. This condition is consistently described across multiple sources, emphasizing that the login workflow must be reachable and present in the environment. The technique specifically involves exploiting SQL injection vulnerabilities to read files, but this exploitation is only feasible under the condition that the login workflow is accessible. The prerequisite environment, referred to as "Reachable Login Workflow," must be present for the technique to be applicable. All descriptions agree that the reachability of the login workflow is essential, with no variation in the core requirement. The technique does not depend on the complexity or security of the login process itself, but rather on its accessibility. Therefore, the presence of a reachable login workflow is a fundamental condition enabling the execution of SQL Injection File Read.</data>
  <data key="d10">is applicable when, requires, applies when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-4c91a7e4da4eea3a.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-045067d746e8d66c.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-bae40e62361a8519.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md</data>
