<edge source="Reachable Login Workflow" target="JWT Token Forgery">
  <data key="d8">31.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Reachable Login Workflow is a security condition that describes the applicability of JWT token forgery techniques under specific circumstances. This condition is met when a reachable login workflow is present, meaning that an attacker can access and interact with the login process of a system. The presence of such a workflow enables the exploitation of JWT token forgery, as it allows the attacker to potentially intercept, manipulate, or generate valid tokens during the authentication sequence. The term "reachable" implies that the login workflow is accessible via the network or application interface, without requiring special privileges or bypassing security controls. Multiple descriptions confirm that the core requirement for this technique is the existence of a login workflow that is both functional and accessible to an external entity. The consistency across the descriptions indicates that the presence of a reachable login workflow is a necessary precondition for the exploitation of JWT token forgery in this context. This relationship highlights a critical vulnerability in systems where authentication mechanisms are not properly secured or where session management relies on JWT tokens that can be forged if the login process is not isolated or protected.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when a reachable login workflow exists.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when the login workflow is reachable.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires a reachable login workflow to be present.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique is applicable when a reachable login workflow exists.</data>
  <data key="d10">applies when,is applicable when,requires</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
