<edge source="Accessible Upload Handler" target="Executable Upload Webshell">
  <data key="d8">44.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Accessible Upload Handler-Executable Upload Webshell is a technique that relies on the presence of an accessible upload handler within a system. This condition is consistently described across all provided descriptions, emphasizing that the technique is applicable only when such a handler is available. The upload handler must be accessible, meaning it can be reached or interacted with by an external entity, such as an attacker. The term "accessible upload handler" is used interchangeably with "accessible upload handler is present" or "an upload handler is accessible," indicating that the core requirement is the availability of a functional upload interface that is not restricted by access controls. The technique is specifically tied to the presence of this handler, which serves as a prerequisite for executing an upload webshell. In this context, the executable upload webshell refers to a malicious payload that can be uploaded through the handler to gain unauthorized control over the system. The consistent emphasis across descriptions highlights that the presence of the accessible upload handler is a necessary and defining condition for the technique to be effective.</data>
  <data key="d10">is applicable when, applies when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e8b98451fa828a77a410acce1592cf2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-0