<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="URL Userinfo Confusion Payload">
  <data key="d8">19.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Offline Password Cracking-URL Userinfo Confusion Payload is a specific payload pattern utilized within the context of offline password cracking techniques. This payload is designed to support and enable the execution of such techniques, particularly by leveraging URL Userinfo Confusion as a method to bypass security filters. The payload pattern is integral to the process, being employed by the offline password cracking technique to exploit ambiguities in URL parsing, especially in the userinfo component of a URL. It is used both as a standalone mechanism and as part of a broader strategy to evade detection during password cracking attempts. The technique relies on this payload to manipulate input handling in ways that allow for the successful execution of offline attacks. Multiple descriptions confirm the consistent use of this payload pattern across different implementations of the technique, emphasizing its role in enabling effective and stealthy password cracking operations. The payload is specifically associated with the URL userinfo confusion method, which is leveraged to create obfuscated or misleading input that can trick systems into processing malicious data. The pattern is not only used in the technique but is also central to its functionality, as it allows attackers to bypass security mechanisms that would otherwise block or detect such attempts. The consistent references across descriptions indicate that this payload is a well-established component within the offline password cracking methodology.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, uses, used by, targets, used in</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
