<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="SQL Comment Auth Bypass Payload">
  <data key="d8">16.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Offline Password Cracking-SQL Comment Auth Bypass Payload is a specific payload pattern utilized in the offline password cracking technique. This payload is designed to exploit authentication bypass mechanisms by leveraging SQL comment syntax, enabling attackers to circumvent security checks during the cracking process. It is commonly employed in scenarios where an attacker aims to extract or bypass authentication credentials without direct interaction with the target system's live environment. The payload supports the offline password cracking technique by allowing the extraction of valid authentication inputs, which can then be used in subsequent cracking attempts. Multiple descriptions confirm that this payload pattern is integral to the offline password cracking methodology, with consistent references to its use in exploiting SQL comment-based authentication bypasses. The technique relies on this payload to manipulate input validation and authentication logic, facilitating the identification of valid credentials. While the descriptions do not vary significantly in content, they collectively emphasize the role of the SQL Comment Auth Bypass Payload as a key enabler within the offline password cracking process. The payload pattern is consistently described as being used in, or supporting, the technique, indicating its functional integration into the broader attack strategy.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, uses, used by, targets, used in</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
