<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="Arbitrary File Read">
  <data key="d8">10.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique requires arbitrary file read capability.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can establish the attacker capability arbitrary file read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires arbitrary file read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can establish the attacker capability of arbitrary file read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports arbitrary file read as an attacker capability.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports arbitrary file read through cracked credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports testing for arbitrary file read.</data>
