<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="Command Execution">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique requires command execution capability.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can establish the attacker capability command execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports command execution as an attacker capability.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports command execution through cracked credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can establish the attacker capability of command execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique enables command execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Offline Password Cracking can establish the attacker capability Command Execution.</data>
