<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="Linux Host">
  <data key="d8">19.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Linux Host-Offline Password Cracking is a technique that leverages the Linux Host technology stack and environment to perform offline password cracking. The method is applicable when a Linux host is present and targets the Linux host environment specifically. It is relevant to the Linux Host technology stack and utilizes the Linux host technology as a foundational component. The technique involves using the Linux host as both a target and a platform for executing password cracking operations offline. It is closely associated with the Linux Host technology stack, which supports this type of security analysis. The technique is designed to operate within the context of a Linux host, making it particularly relevant for systems where the target environment is based on Linux. This approach is commonly used in cybersecurity assessments to evaluate the strength of passwords in scenarios where direct access to the system is not possible, and the password hashes are extracted for offline analysis. The technique is consistently described as being relevant to the Linux Host technology stack and environment, emphasizing its dependency on Linux-based systems for implementation.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, relevant to, is relevant to, uses, targets, applies when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
