<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="Read Sensitive Data">
  <data key="d8">27.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Offline Password Cracking-Read Sensitive Data is a technique that supports the attack goal of reading sensitive data. This method enables adversaries to extract or access confidential information by cracking passwords offline, thereby bypassing real-time authentication mechanisms. The technique is specifically designed to facilitate the unauthorized retrieval of sensitive data, such as personal information, credentials, or proprietary content, by exploiting weak or compromised passwords. It may involve the use of brute-force, dictionary, or hybrid attacks on password hashes obtained from a system, allowing the attacker to recover plaintext passwords and gain access to protected data. The technique supports both the direct achievement of the goal to read sensitive data and the testing of systems for vulnerabilities related to password security. It is commonly employed in penetration testing and cyberattacks to assess or exploit weaknesses in authentication systems. While primarily associated with malicious intent, it can also be used in ethical hacking scenarios to evaluate the resilience of password protection mechanisms. The effectiveness of this technique depends on factors such as password complexity, hashing algorithms, and computational resources available to the attacker.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, can support, supports testing for, achieves, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001</data>
