<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="Execute Code">
  <data key="d8">13.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Execute Code-Offline Password Cracking is a technique that supports the attack goal of executing code. This method leverages offline password cracking processes to achieve code execution, often by exploiting weaknesses in password storage or authentication mechanisms. The technique enables an attacker to gain unauthorized access to systems or data by cracking passwords outside of the target environment, thereby bypassing real-time security controls. Once passwords are cracked, the attacker can use them to access systems and execute arbitrary code, fulfilling the objective of code execution. The technique is specifically designed to support the attack goal of executing code, with the offline nature of password cracking allowing for more efficient and stealthy exploitation. In some contexts, the technique is directly associated with the goal of executing code, emphasizing its role in enabling unauthorized system access and control. Offline Password Cracking, as part of this technique, can be used to support the broader objective of code execution by providing credentials that grant access to systems where code can be run.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, achieves, supports achieving, can support</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-001</data>
