<edge source="Offline Password Cracking" target="HTTP Redirect Or Cookie">
  <data key="d8">18.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique known as HTTP Redirect Or Cookie-Offline Password Cracking can be indicated by an HTTP redirect or a cookie change. These signals—either an HTTP redirect or a modification in cookie values—are used to determine the success of the technique. The presence of such a redirect or cookie change serves as an indicator that the method has been effective. In some cases, the technique may produce an HTTP redirect or a cookie as a signal, which can then be observed to confirm success. The redirect or cookie change is consistently described as a reliable indicator of the technique's outcome, with multiple descriptions emphasizing that such a change signifies successful execution. While the descriptions vary slightly in phrasing, they all converge on the same core idea: the detection of an HTTP redirect or a cookie alteration provides evidence that the technique has succeeded.&lt;SEP&gt;An HTTP redirect or cookie indicates the technique's success.&lt;SEP&gt;An HTTP redirect or cookie change can indicate the success of the technique.&lt;SEP&gt;A redirect or cookie change indicates the success of the technique.</data>
  <data key="d10">indicated by,indicates,produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e8b98451fa828a77a410acce1592cf2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-d1ffa3e33fee59c7.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3f0581573d61b7bd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-16c3d9d4e9cc3637.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md</data>
