<edge source="WinRM Credential Login" target="Escalate Privileges">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Escalate Privileges-WinRM Credential Login is a technique that supports the goal of escalating privileges within a system. This method leverages WinRM (Windows Remote Management) credential login to gain elevated access by exploiting authentication mechanisms. The technique is designed to achieve privilege escalation, enabling an attacker to move from a lower-privileged account to one with higher permissions. It can be used in both offensive security testing and actual attack scenarios to test or exploit vulnerabilities related to WinRM authentication. The approach supports the broader attack objective of escalating privileges by utilizing valid credentials or compromised credentials to authenticate through WinRM, thereby facilitating unauthorized access to system resources. This technique is particularly relevant in environments where WinRM is enabled and credentials are not properly secured. While the descriptions consistently emphasize the role of WinRM Credential Login in privilege escalation, they do not specify the exact methods or tools involved, focusing instead on the functional outcome. The technique is applicable in scenarios where remote management services are used, and it aligns with common attack patterns involving credential theft or reuse.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, can support, supports testing for, supports attack goal, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000</data>
