<edge source="WinRM Credential Login" target="Password Hash">
  <data key="d8">8.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (Password Hash, WinRM Credential Login) describes a technical interaction where the WinRM Credential Login technique is involved in the generation and consumption of password hash artifacts. Specifically, the WinRM Credential Login process can produce password hash artifacts, which are typically generated during authentication attempts using Windows Remote Management (WinRM). These password hashes may be captured as part of security monitoring or forensic analysis when credentials are transmitted or verified. While the primary function of the technique is to facilitate remote authentication via WinRM, it is also associated with the creation of password hash artifacts, which can be used for further analysis or attack simulation. Notably, some descriptions indicate that the technique consumes password hashes, suggesting a dual role: it may both generate and utilize password hashes in the authentication workflow. This dual behavior implies that the technique not only produces hash artifacts during login attempts but may also rely on pre-existing password hashes for credential validation. The presence of conflicting information—producing versus consuming password hashes—may reflect different phases of the same process or varying interpretations of the technique's behavior. However, both functions are relevant to the overall operational context of WinRM Credential Login, highlighting its role in both generating and potentially using password hash artifacts in the authentication chain.</data>
  <data key="d10">can produce,consumes,produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d12">source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-16c3d9d4e9cc3637.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-bae40e62361a8519.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md</data>
  <data key="d13">1787913614</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
