<edge source="Executable Upload Webshell" target="Read Sensitive Data">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique known as Executable Upload Webshell-Read Sensitive Data supports the goal of reading sensitive data. This technique can be utilized to achieve the attack goal of reading sensitive data, and it is specifically designed to enable the extraction of confidential information from a compromised system. It supports testing for the ability to read sensitive data, allowing security professionals to evaluate system vulnerabilities related to data exposure. The technique is aligned with the objective of reading sensitive data and can be employed to validate the effectiveness of defensive measures against unauthorized data access. In various contexts, this technique may be used to assess or exploit weaknesses in web application security, particularly when a webshell has been uploaded through executable upload mechanisms. The technique facilitates the retrieval of sensitive information, thereby supporting both offensive and defensive operations in cybersecurity assessments.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, supports testing for, can support, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002</data>
