<edge source="Executable Upload Webshell" target="Execute Code">
  <data key="d8">15.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Executable Upload Webshell-Execute Code is a technique that supports the execution of code on a target system. This method enables an attacker to upload an executable file, typically in the form of a webshell, to a vulnerable web server or application. Once uploaded, the webshell can be used to execute arbitrary commands on the target system, thereby achieving the attack goal of executing code. The technique is specifically designed to facilitate remote code execution by leveraging weaknesses in file upload functionality or server-side vulnerabilities. It supports the broader objective of gaining unauthorized access and control over the target environment. The technique can be employed to achieve the attack goal of executing code, either directly or through the use of a webshell that provides a backdoor for command execution. The process involves uploading a malicious payload, which, when executed, allows the attacker to run commands on the target system. This technique is commonly used in cyberattacks to maintain persistence, escalate privileges, or exfiltrate data. The term "Executable Upload Webshell-Execute Code" refers to the integration of file upload capabilities with webshell deployment to enable code execution, making it a critical component in the exploitation of web applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique achieves the goal of executing code.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can support the attack goal of executing code.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports achieving the goal of executing code.</data>
  <data key="d10">achieves,can support,supports,supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002</data>
