<edge source="Executable Upload Webshell" target="Command Execution">
  <data key="d8">12.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Command Execution-Executable Upload Webshell is a technique that enables the establishment of command execution capability on a target system. This method requires existing command execution capability to be effective, and it can be used to produce or reinforce the attacker's ability to execute commands on the compromised system. The technique allows an attacker to gain and maintain control by enabling command execution, thereby establishing a persistent means of interaction with the target. It can be leveraged to create or enhance the attacker's capability to execute arbitrary commands, often through the upload and execution of malicious web-based payloads. This capability is critical for further exploitation, data exfiltration, or lateral movement within a network. The technique is specifically designed to enable command execution as a core function, and it can be used to establish or strengthen the attacker's control over the target environment.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, establishes, produces, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-370982d0d06e0982.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md</data>
