<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="URL Userinfo Confusion Payload">
  <data key="d8">14.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-URL Userinfo Confusion Payload is a technique that leverages a specific payload pattern to exploit vulnerabilities in JWT (JSON Web Token) token forgery. This method specifically targets the URL userinfo confusion payload, which refers to a security issue where user information in a URL's userinfo component is improperly processed or validated. The payload pattern is integral to the forgery technique, enabling attackers to manipulate token claims by injecting malicious data through the userinfo section of a URL. The technique uses the URL userinfo confusion payload pattern to bypass authentication mechanisms, allowing unauthorized access or privilege escalation. It is commonly employed in scenarios where systems fail to properly sanitize or validate input from URLs, particularly when user-supplied data is used to generate or verify JWT tokens. The payload pattern is not only used in the technique but is also central to its execution, as it facilitates the creation of forged tokens that appear legitimate to the system. This approach highlights a critical intersection between URL parsing vulnerabilities and JWT security, emphasizing the importance of robust input validation and secure token handling practices.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, uses, targets</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-d1ffa3e33fee59c7.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-045067d746e8d66c.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
