<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Shell Access">
  <data key="d8">34.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Shell Access refers to a cybersecurity technique that involves the manipulation of JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) to gain unauthorized shell access on a target system. This technique requires shell access as a prerequisite, enabling the execution of commands and code on the target environment. While some descriptions indicate that shell access is necessary for the technique to function, others suggest that the technique can establish shell access as an attacker capability. This implies a bidirectional relationship: shell access may be required to initiate JWT token forgery, or the forgery process may be used to achieve shell access. The technique supports the establishment of shell access, allowing attackers to execute arbitrary commands and maintain persistent control over the system. It is also described as enabling the attacker capability of shell access, emphasizing its role in expanding an attacker’s control. The technique is capable of establishing shell access on the target, reinforcing its function as a method to achieve elevated privileges. Overall, JWT Token Forgery-Shell Access represents a dual-purpose capability, where the technique either depends on existing shell access or facilitates its acquisition, depending on the context of exploitation.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, supports achieving, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-429f1cea7765f3e2.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-d1ffa3e33fee59c7.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7ff057962935cb60.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4c91a7e4da4eea3a.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-938bc49bb5da258f.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-045067d746e8d66c.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-bae40e62361a8519.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md</data>
