<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Privilege Escalation Path">
  <data key="d8">21.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Privilege Escalation Path refers to a cybersecurity technique where the forging of JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) is leveraged to establish a privilege escalation path. This technique enables an attacker to gain elevated access rights within a system by exploiting weaknesses in JWT validation mechanisms. The process requires a privilege escalation path, which is both a prerequisite and a capability that the technique can establish. Specifically, the technique supports achieving the capability of privilege escalation path, allowing the attacker to move from a lower-privilege state to a higher-privilege one. It can establish this path as an attacker capability, enabling the exploitation of system resources beyond the initial access level. The technique is dependent on the existence of a privilege escalation path, which may be enabled by vulnerabilities in authentication or authorization processes. In some cases, the privilege escalation path is a prerequisite for the technique to succeed, while in others, the technique itself enables the creation of such a path. The technique can establish a privilege escalation path on the target system, and it supports the achievement of higher access levels by enabling the attacker to forge valid tokens that bypass normal access controls. The relationship between JWT token forgery and privilege escalation is bidirectional: while the technique relies on a privilege escalation path to succeed, it also serves to create or enable that path. This interdependence highlights the critical nature of secure JWT implementation and validation in preventing unauthorized privilege escalation.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, supports achieving, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000</data>
