<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Boolean Response Delta">
  <data key="d8">20.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Boolean Response Delta-JWT Token Forgery refers to a technique in which a boolean response delta serves as an indicator of the success or outcome of a JWT token forgery attempt. This response delta is a signal generated by the system in response to the attempted forgery, and it reflects whether the forged token was accepted or rejected. The boolean nature of the response delta means it provides a binary outcome—typically true or false—representing success or failure of the attack. Multiple descriptions emphasize that this delta can indicate the success of the technique, with some specifying that it reflects the result of the JWT token forgery process. The signal is generated as part of the system’s response mechanism, and its presence or value can be used to infer whether the forged token was validated by the target system. The technique is thus detectable through monitoring for such response deltas, which act as a measurable artifact of the attack's effectiveness. The consistency across descriptions confirms that the boolean response delta is a key observable metric in assessing the success of JWT token forgery attempts.</data>
  <data key="d10">indicates, indicated by, generates</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
