<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="JWT Secret Weakness">
  <data key="d8">25.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Secret Weakness-JWT Token Forgery is a technique that exploits vulnerabilities arising from weak or predictable JWT (JSON Web Token) secrets. This technique targets the JWT secret weakness vulnerability class, which occurs when the secret key used for signing JWT tokens is either too weak, easily guessable, or improperly managed. By leveraging this weakness, the technique enables the forgery of JWT tokens, allowing an attacker to impersonate legitimate users or gain unauthorized access to systems. The method involves testing or exploiting the flawed JWT secret validation process, where the absence of strong cryptographic practices allows malicious actors to generate valid tokens without possessing the legitimate secret. This vulnerability class is particularly dangerous because it undermines the integrity and authenticity guarantees provided by JWTs, which are commonly used for authentication and authorization in web applications. The technique may be used to obtain sensitive secrets or escalate privileges within a system, highlighting the importance of using cryptographically strong, randomly generated secrets and secure key management practices. In cases where the JWT secret is weak or predictable, the technique can be reliably executed to compromise security.</data>
  <data key="d10">targets, exploits, applies when, tests or exploits</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
