<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Credential Exposure">
  <data key="d8">30.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Credential Exposure-JWT Token Forgery is a technique that targets and exploits the vulnerability class of credential exposure. This technique leverages exposed credentials—often resulting from insecure storage, transmission, or misconfigurations—to gain unauthorized access. It specifically tests or exploits the credential exposure vulnerability class, which includes weaknesses such as leaked API keys, tokens, or authentication credentials. By exploiting these exposed credentials, the technique enables the forgery of JWT (JSON Web Token) tokens, allowing attackers to impersonate legitimate users or bypass authentication mechanisms. The process may involve retrieving credentials from sources like insecure logs, client-side storage, or network traffic, and using them to generate valid JWT tokens. This attack is closely tied to the broader class of credential exposure vulnerabilities and weaknesses, which are commonly found in applications with poor security hygiene. The technique emphasizes the misuse of exposed credentials to forge tokens, thereby compromising system integrity and enabling unauthorized access. In some cases, the technique may also involve exploiting credential exposure weaknesses to obtain credentials directly, which are then used in the token forgery process. The vulnerability class is a central component of the attack, as it provides the initial foothold for the technique to succeed.</data>
  <data key="d10">targets, exploits, tests or exploits</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-d1ffa3e33fee59c7.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7ff057962935cb60.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4c91a7e4da4eea3a.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-938bc49bb5da258f.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-045067d746e8d66c.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-bae40e62361a8519.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f43f768c997245d2.md</data>
