<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="JWT Secret">
  <data key="d8">28.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Secret-JWT Token Forgery is a technique that focuses on the JWT secret, either by exploiting weaknesses related to it or by generating the JWT secret as an artifact. The technique can produce a JWT secret, often in the form of an artifact, and is specifically associated with the creation or extraction of the JWT secret. It is capable of generating the JWT secret artifact, the JWT secret itself, or the artifact of a JWT secret, depending on the context of the attack. This process may involve producing multiple JWT secrets or a single JWT secret artifact. The technique is closely tied to the manipulation or testing of the JWT secret's security, indicating that it may be used to assess or exploit vulnerabilities in systems that rely on JWT (JSON Web Token) authentication. In some cases, the technique is employed to forge JWT tokens by leveraging the produced JWT secret, highlighting its role in both secret generation and token forgery. The consistent emphasis on artifact production suggests that the technique is not only about identifying or exploiting the secret but also about creating a usable representation of it for further malicious use.</data>
  <data key="d10">produced, tests or exploits, can produce, produces, targets</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
