<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Token Signing Ability">
  <data key="d8">29.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Token Signing Ability refers to a security technique that involves the ability to sign JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) in order to forge valid tokens. This technique requires the attacker to possess token signing ability, which is the capability to generate a valid digital signature for a JWT using the appropriate secret key or private key. The ability to sign tokens enables the forgery of JWTs, allowing an attacker to impersonate a legitimate user or gain unauthorized access to systems. This capability is essential for the technique to succeed, as without it, the forged tokens cannot be validated by the system. The technique may also involve establishing or acquiring token signing ability, particularly in scenarios where the attacker gains access to the signing key or exploits misconfigurations. In some cases, the technique can enable or support the establishment of token signing ability as an attacker capability, either through direct access to cryptographic keys or by exploiting vulnerabilities in the token generation process. The technique is closely tied to the attacker’s ability to perform token signing, and it is this capability that makes JWT token forgery possible. The term emphasizes that the core requirement for executing this attack is control over the signing mechanism, whether through key exposure, algorithm substitution, or other means.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
