<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Database Dump">
  <data key="d8">20.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Database Dump-JWT Token Forgery refers to a relationship in which the technique of JWT Token Forgery is capable of producing a database dump as an artifact. JWT Token Forgery involves the manipulation or creation of invalid JSON Web Tokens to gain unauthorized access to systems or data. When successfully exploited, this technique can lead to the extraction of sensitive information stored in a database, resulting in a database dump. The resulting database dump is a collection of data extracted from the database, often in the form of files or structured records. Multiple descriptions confirm that the technique can produce the artifact of a database dump, with variations in phrasing such as "database dump artifacts" or "database dump as an artifact." These descriptions consistently indicate that the outcome of JWT Token Forgery may include the generation of a database dump, highlighting the potential severity of such an attack in terms of data exposure. The relationship emphasizes the direct link between the exploitation of JWT vulnerabilities and the possibility of obtaining comprehensive data from a compromised system.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can produce a database dump artifact.</data>
  <data key="d10">can produce,produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001</data>
