<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Protocol Allowlist">
  <data key="d8">14.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Protocol Allowlist is a defensive control mechanism designed to mitigate JWT token forgery attempts by restricting the set of allowed protocols. This control operates by enforcing a protocol allowlist, which permits only specific, pre-approved protocols while blocking others. The technique of JWT token forgery may be blocked by this control, as it prevents unauthorized or malicious protocol usage that could facilitate token manipulation. However, certain techniques can bypass the protocol allowlist control, enabling attackers to circumvent this defensive measure. These bypass methods may exploit weaknesses in how the allowlist is implemented or enforced, allowing forged JWT tokens to be processed despite protocol restrictions. While the control aims to enhance security by limiting protocol flexibility, its effectiveness depends on the robustness of the allowlist configuration and the absence of exploitable bypass techniques. In some cases, the technique may be blocked by the allowlist, but in others, it can bypass the control entirely, highlighting the need for additional safeguards to complement protocol-based restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d10">blocks, may be blocked by, may bypass, bypasses, mitigates</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0ebb35df72c979d0b12d18b62e291d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-67d16a04c4799edd.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-516d729c800024a5.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f0615c6655a21111.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-b5628ce0b17f7e70.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-0d4e246da395857e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-7e31c39a962ccdd6.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md</data>
