<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Arbitrary File Read">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Arbitrary file read can enable JWT token forgery.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires arbitrary file read capability.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports arbitrary file read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can establish the attacker capability Arbitrary File Read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires arbitrary file read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique supports achieving the capability of arbitrary file read.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can establish the attacker capability of arbitrary file read.</data>
