<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="HTTP Redirect Or Cookie">
  <data key="d8">15.0</data>
  <data key="d9">HTTP Redirect Or Cookie-JWT Token Forgery refers to a security technique in which the success of forging a JSON Web Token (JWT) is indicated by changes in the HTTP redirect or the presence of a modified cookie. This method relies on observing behavioral signals during authentication or session management processes. Specifically, a successful JWT token forgery is often signaled by an HTTP redirect to a different URL or a change in the cookie value, particularly one associated with session tokens or authentication tokens. These changes serve as indicators that the forged token has been accepted by the server, thereby confirming the technique's success. The redirect or cookie modification reflects the system's response to the forged token, suggesting that the attacker has bypassed authentication controls. The term may also be used interchangeably with "JWT forgery" or "cookie-JWT token forgery," emphasizing the role of HTTP redirects and cookies as observable evidence of a successful attack. In some cases, the signal may be triggered by the server redirecting the user to a new page upon validating the forged token, or by the automatic insertion of a malicious cookie into the browser. This technique is commonly leveraged in scenarios involving session hijacking, token manipulation, or authentication bypass attacks. The consistency of redirect and cookie-based indicators across multiple descriptions suggests that these are reliable markers for detecting such exploits.&lt;SEP&gt;An HTTP redirect or cookie change can indicate the success of the technique.&lt;SEP&gt;HTTP redirect or cookie can indicate the success of the technique.&lt;SEP&gt;A HTTP redirect or cookie indicates the technique's success.</data>
  <data key="d10">indicated by,indicates</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
