<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Linux Host">
  <data key="d8">12.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Linux Host refers to a cybersecurity technique involving the manipulation of JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) in environments where Linux hosts are present. This technique is relevant to the technology stack associated with Linux Host systems and is applicable when a Linux host is part of the infrastructure. The method leverages the Linux host technology to execute or facilitate the forgery of JWTs, often targeting Linux host environments for exploitation. It is specifically tied to Linux host systems, utilizing their configuration, services, or applications to compromise authentication mechanisms. The technique targets Linux hosts and Linux host environments, indicating its focus on systems operating under the Linux operating system. It uses Linux host technology and may involve exploiting vulnerabilities in authentication processes, such as weak signing keys or improper validation, within Linux-based applications. The relevance of JWT Token Forgery to Linux Host is consistent across multiple descriptions, emphasizing the dependency on Linux host infrastructure for successful execution. This technique highlights the importance of securing JWT-based authentication in Linux environments, where misconfigurations or vulnerabilities can lead to unauthorized access or privilege escalation.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, relevant to, is relevant to, uses, targets, applies when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000</data>
