<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Read Sensitive Data">
  <data key="d8">23.0</data>
  <data key="d9">JWT Token Forgery-Read Sensitive Data is a technique that supports the attack goal of reading sensitive data. This technique enables an attacker to forge JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) in order to gain unauthorized access to protected resources. By manipulating or伪造 JWTs, an attacker can bypass authentication mechanisms and access data that should otherwise be restricted. The technique achieves this goal by exploiting vulnerabilities in JWT validation processes, such as weak signature algorithms, improper key management, or lack of proper token expiration checks. It supports reading sensitive data by allowing access to endpoints or services that require authenticated access, thereby enabling the retrieval of confidential information. The technique can support the attack goal of reading sensitive data through various means, including accessing user profiles, session data, or administrative functions. It may also be used in testing scenarios to evaluate the robustness of authentication systems against token forgery attacks. The goal of reading sensitive data is directly supported by the ability to forge tokens and access protected resources, making JWT Token Forgery a critical concern in systems relying on JWT-based authentication.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, can support, supports testing for, achieves, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
