<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Client-Side Authorization">
  <data key="d8">9.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The technique known as (Client-Side Authorization, JWT Token Forgery) exploits vulnerabilities related to client-side authorization, specifically targeting weaknesses in how authorization checks are enforced on the client side. This vulnerability class involves scenarios where security decisions—such as access control or permission validation—are performed in the client application rather than on the server, making them susceptible to manipulation. The technique leverages this misconfiguration by enabling attackers to bypass legitimate authorization mechanisms, often through the forgery of JWT (JSON Web Token) tokens. By manipulating or forging these tokens, an attacker can impersonate a legitimate user or gain elevated privileges without proper server-side validation. This form of exploitation highlights a critical security flaw in systems that rely on client-side enforcement of access controls. The technique may involve testing or actively exploiting these vulnerabilities to demonstrate or achieve unauthorized access. The vulnerability class itself is directly exploited by this technique, which underscores the importance of shifting authorization logic to the server side and ensuring robust token validation. In some cases, the technique may also involve crafting or modifying JWT tokens to include forged claims, thereby circumventing intended access restrictions. Overall, (Client-Side Authorization, JWT Token Forgery) represents a significant security risk in applications that fail to enforce authorization policies server-side.</data>
  <data key="d10">exploits,tests or exploits</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001</data>
