<edge source="Escalate Privileges" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d8">19.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Escalate Privileges-SSRF Localhost Probing is a technique that supports the goal of escalating privileges, particularly within the context of security testing and attack scenarios. This method leverages Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) to probe localhost or internal network services, enabling an attacker to interact with applications or systems that are not directly accessible from external networks. By exploiting SSRF vulnerabilities, an attacker can access internal endpoints, potentially revealing sensitive information or identifying misconfigured services that can be used to gain elevated privileges. The technique is often employed to test for privilege escalation opportunities, as it allows for the discovery of internal resources that may be vulnerable to exploitation. It supports both the achievement and testing of privilege escalation objectives, making it a valuable tool in penetration testing and red team operations. The process typically involves crafting malicious requests that are processed by a vulnerable server, which then makes internal calls to localhost or internal IP addresses, thereby exposing potential attack vectors. This technique is particularly effective in environments where internal services are accessible but not properly isolated, and where authentication or authorization mechanisms are weak or absent. Overall, Escalate Privileges-SSRF Localhost Probing serves as a means to exploit SSRF vulnerabilities to achieve privilege escalation by accessing and interacting with internal systems.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, can support, supports goal of, supports testing for, supports achieving</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
