<edge source="Read Sensitive Data" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d8">14.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Read Sensitive Data-SSRF Localhost Probing is a technique that supports the attack goal of reading sensitive data. This method leverages Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerabilities to probe localhost or internal network resources, enabling an attacker to access data that is typically restricted from external access. By exploiting SSRF, an attacker can craft requests that are processed by a server and directed to internal endpoints, such as local services or databases, which may contain sensitive information. The technique is specifically designed to test for the ability to read sensitive data, making it a critical component in assessing the security posture of web applications and backend systems. It is commonly used in penetration testing and vulnerability assessments to identify misconfigurations or insecure service implementations that could allow unauthorized data access. The technique may involve probing internal services, such as configuration management systems, metadata endpoints, or internal APIs, to retrieve information like credentials, configuration files, or application secrets. While the primary purpose is to test for the possibility of reading sensitive data, it can also be used as a stepping stone for further exploitation if such data is obtained. The effectiveness of this technique depends on the server's ability to make requests to internal networks and the absence of proper input validation or network segmentation. In some cases, it may also be used to bypass firewalls or access services that are not exposed to the public internet. Overall, Read Sensitive Data-SSRF Localhost Probing is a well-documented attack vector that highlights the risks associated with improper SSRF mitigation and the importance of securing internal network communication.</data>
  <data key="d10">supports, supports goal of, supports testing for, can support</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001</data>
