<edge source="Privilege Escalation Path" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d8">18.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Privilege Escalation Path-SSRF Localhost Probing refers to a cybersecurity technique that leverages a privilege escalation path to enable Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) attacks targeting localhost. This technique is applicable when a privilege escalation path is present, and it requires such a path to function effectively. The presence of a privilege escalation path allows an attacker to exploit SSRF vulnerabilities to probe localhost, thereby gaining unauthorized access to internal services or systems. The technique supports the attacker's capability to escalate privileges, enabling them to achieve higher levels of access within a system. It also supports testing for the existence of a privilege escalation path, as well as the capability to establish such an escalation. The technique relies on the prerequisite of a privilege escalation path, which is essential for gaining elevated privileges. Additionally, the technique supports the attacker’s ability to perform SSRF localhost probing as a means to exploit vulnerabilities in environments where privilege escalation is possible. This approach highlights the interplay between privilege escalation and SSRF, where the former enables the latter in internal network reconnaissance and exploitation.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, supports testing for, supports achieving, enables, applies when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
