<edge source="Shell Access" target="SQL Injection File Read">
  <data key="d8">34.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SQL Injection File Read-Shell Access is a technique that enables an attacker to gain shell access on a target system by exploiting SQL injection vulnerabilities to read files, which can then be used to achieve command execution and establish a shell. The technique requires shell access as an attacker capability, and it can establish this capability by leveraging the ability to read files through SQL injection. This process allows the attacker to obtain a shell access capability, enabling them to execute arbitrary commands on the compromised system. The technique supports shell access as a capability and can establish the attacker's ability to gain shell access, often by reading files that contain sensitive data or executable code. It is also noted that the technique requires shell access to execute commands and that the attacker capability of shell access is necessary for the technique to be effective. In some cases, the technique can establish shell access as an attacker capability through the exploitation of file reading vulnerabilities via SQL injection. Overall, SQL Injection File Read-Shell Access is a method that combines file reading through SQL injection with the establishment of shell access, allowing the attacker to gain control over the target system.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-becce52057339c535889e197f6df8c45-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4fe7170e2d9c9211e7f5a9c957dd660-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2c01c9361375f50dd8673c9eb15cacd0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a49f72fdeac26b85fd80fd22bf2c4b9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9ddc793324d868b5ed0d90f4c192307-chunk-000</data>
