<edge source="Shell Access" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d8">25.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SSRF Localhost Probing-Shell Access refers to a cybersecurity technique involving Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) that enables an attacker to probe localhost endpoints and potentially gain shell access on a target system. This technique requires shell access as a prerequisite capability, which allows the attacker to execute commands on the target system. Shell access is both a requirement and an enabling factor for the SSRF localhost probing technique, as it facilitates the execution of commands and the establishment of a foothold within the system. The technique supports the attacker’s capability to obtain shell access, either by enabling such access directly or by testing for its presence. In some cases, the technique can produce shell access on the target, making it a critical pathway for privilege escalation and system compromise. The capability of shell access is essential for the technique to function effectively, and its presence enables the probing of internal services and network configurations through localhost. While the descriptions emphasize the necessity of shell access, they also indicate that the technique can be used to validate or achieve this access, highlighting its dual role as both a requirement and a potential outcome. The technique supports the attacker's ability to leverage SSRF to probe internal systems, with shell access serving as a key enabler for further exploitation.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, supports testing for, produces, enables, can establish</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
