  <data key="d9">Boolean Response Delta-SSRF Localhost Probing refers to a technique used in security testing to detect Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerabilities, particularly when probing localhost endpoints. The method relies on observing a boolean response delta—a measurable difference in the system's response—indicating the outcome of the probing attempt. This delta serves as a signal for the success of the SSRF localhost probing technique, reflecting whether the target system successfully processed the request to a local endpoint. The response delta can manifest as a change in the response content, timing, or status code, which allows an analyst to infer the presence of a vulnerability. In some cases, the presence of a boolean response delta may indicate a successful probe, suggesting that the application is vulnerable to SSRF attacks. The technique produces a boolean response delta as a detectable outcome, and the delta can be used to confirm the result of the probing activity. While the primary purpose of the delta is to indicate success, it may also reflect the overall result of the technique, including whether a vulnerability was exploited. The signal is interpreted as a positive indicator of successful probing, though its interpretation may vary depending on the specific implementation and environment. The technique can be indicated by a boolean response delta, which functions as a key metric in assessing the effectiveness of the SSRF attack vector.</data>
  <data key="d10">produces, indicates, indicated by</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001</data>
