<edge source="SSRF Localhost Probing" target="Internal Service Reachability">
  <data key="d8">30.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Internal Service Reachability-SSRF Localhost Probing refers to a cybersecurity technique that leverages Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) to probe localhost services, contingent upon the presence of internal service reachability. This technique enables an attacker to exploit vulnerabilities in web applications that allow them to make requests from the server's perspective, potentially accessing internal services that are not exposed to the public internet. Internal service reachability is a prerequisite for the technique, as it provides the attacker with the capability to access and interact with internal network resources, including services running on localhost. The technique supports testing for internal service reachability and can establish the attacker's capability to reach internal services, thereby enabling the probing of localhost-based services. While the technique requires internal service reachability, it also facilitates the establishment of this capability, creating a feedback loop where the probing itself can confirm or expand the attacker’s access. This capability is essential for the technique to function, as it allows the attacker to determine whether internal services are accessible and to potentially exploit them. The technique is applicable when internal service reachability is present and is supported as an attacker capability in various security assessments. In summary, Internal Service Reachability-SSRF Localhost Probing is both dependent on and instrumental in achieving internal service reachability, making it a critical consideration in assessing the security posture of systems exposed to SSRF vulnerabilities.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires, supports, establishes, supports testing for, produces, enables, can establish, applies when</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0584c585862d9a9383e3c2512964e051-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67f151b5c1ed66e0d6be294a338e261a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20e319f206fb018ed527c5b31c09ddf0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ffd8f37d7d75ed447c448d9b518f200d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1460b2cac00bc568a22b020dc995d48d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8261eb5533257b5d5534c19022f92a0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92c7622093c392d46fd0e476d89c0395-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1a922685f9944c8d348cfa4732a95f15-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8df9b099194a66605da7b496d31a4a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ca4ebbe397b88a5e1985154047a1fd42-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b7c72285e15bcd2791980b58faff89f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
