<edge source="SSRF Localhost Probing" target="HTTP Redirect Or Cookie">
  <data key="d8">9.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (HTTP Redirect Or Cookie, SSRF Localhost Probing) refers to a signal used to indicate the success of a Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) attack targeting localhost. This technique involves probing internal network resources by exploiting vulnerabilities in server-side applications, and the success of such an attack can be detected through observable changes in HTTP behavior. Specifically, an HTTP redirect or a change in cookies serves as a reliable indicator that the SSRF Localhost Probing was successful. These signals—either a redirect to a different URL or a modification in the cookie set by the server—arise when the server processes the malicious request and responds in a way that reflects internal access. The presence of such a redirect or cookie change can be interpreted as confirmation that the attacker's probe reached the targeted internal endpoint, thereby validating the vulnerability. This behavior is consistent across multiple instances of the technique, where the HTTP redirect or cookie modification acts as a feedback mechanism, signaling the outcome of the SSRF attempt. The relation captures the connection between the technical action (SSRF Localhost Probing) and its observable outcome (HTTP Redirect Or Cookie), making it a key diagnostic marker in security assessments and vulnerability detection.&lt;SEP&gt;An HTTP redirect or cookie indicates the success of the technique.</data>
  <data key="d10">indicated by,indicates,produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20d020c04f02649ff62131f95e1cf5af-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5e4ee546aa8f7ecfb659ca7fb68e9be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da0c7cc16e444f7a837833f0b1605208-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f6a368a385f7056f3a4e83a6daacc92e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b9fbca654baa1f52872a4a45acdf6ffb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-880110b45de32b68e00014bf0300aced-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-3002b69a47310ca1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-045067d746e8d66c.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-db59b660c03f0d7d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-2e266fadcba1fc0d.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-829d6e7cad18eac1.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-eae76c910437f664.md</data>
