<edge source="Virtual Host Discovery" target="Virtual Host Name">
  <data key="d8">11.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (Virtual Host Discovery, Virtual Host Name) refers to the process by which the virtual host discovery technique generates a virtual host name as an artifact or result. This technique is designed to identify and extract virtual host names from networked systems, often during security assessments or reconnaissance activities. The virtual host name artifact represents a specific hostname associated with a web server that hosts multiple websites using the same IP address. The discovery process may involve methods such as HTTP header analysis, DNS enumeration, or web server fingerprinting to uncover these names. The resulting virtual host name is typically recorded as a discrete data artifact, which can be used for further analysis, mapping, or vulnerability assessment. Multiple descriptions emphasize that the technique consistently produces this artifact, indicating its reliability and predictability in generating virtual host name information. The term "artifact" is used interchangeably with "result," underscoring that the virtual host name is a tangible output of the discovery process. The relation is primarily technical and operational, focused on the extraction and documentation of virtual host names within network environments.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique produces a virtual host name artifact.</data>
  <data key="d10">produces</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-774dd7b69cee60333fe159b91c5115dc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4689e3344d4cedcec51062aefaf0b4c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c971a08d484b9763ebcf9e596a7147e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f480ea9fcbb09d97e0819addf2df923b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02d8de5bc4d7ef5b5730e6de21983a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e8a9899a4d34db71efbd953d99c628b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4f1b727935e166da3087ad74c41475b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8ad4036a778fcc22e1513e5f0c0a8591-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d12">source-1bcb83f8254416e4.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-463bc40b9d3a7e65.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-4dbc50aa9b3261a0.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-12ff71155a138664.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-a9ccf5fa80acec79.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-ec1ac76eae51358e.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-edb2f8f9e3bad28b.md&lt;SEP&gt;source-f185a95c8594da55.md</data>
